            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Disclosed are a battery system and a vehicle including the same, the battery system including a battery module, a pack casing in which the battery module is installed, and an elastic part installed between the pack casing and the battery module and configured to press the battery module based on the pack casing, the elastic part having an end supported on the pack casing or the battery module by means of a cap made of a fire resistance material.</p>
